   "approx": "Below 50 % foe health, boosts over_time direct hits by 25 % (`dmg_more`) and echoes 25 % of each post-defence Wood tick directly via `tick_dealt` `return_damage` (`dtype: \"soul\"` bypasses a second resistance pass and non-tick flat block, matching exact +25 % Wood burn damage in both Python and GDScript); out-of-fight Đan Đạo +1 craft rule is not modeled in combat.",
   "records": [
    {
